_exptl_special_details           
;
 The crystal was mounted at rt with perfluoroether oil on top of a MITEGEN
 mount and placed in a cold nitrogen gas stream on the diffractometer.

 The collected data cover more than a hemisphere of the reciprocal space.
 A combination of 29 sets of \w scans were used; each set at different \j,
 2\q or \k angles and each scan 0.3 deg in \w.
 Each frame was exposured for 0.52 s.
 Nominal crystal to detector distance 32 mm.
;

